Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(system-prompt): replace hardcoded identity with
 butley-system-prompt.md (#4)

* feat(system-prompt): replace hardcoded identity with butley-system-prompt.md

* fix(system-prompt): allow discussing config/capabilities but never name the underlying framework

* docs(system-prompt): add file routing, memory explanation, files directive, remove safety to AGENTS.md

* fix(system-prompt): inline prompt as TS export instead of runtime file read

* fix(system-prompt): strengthen confidentiality rules - never reveal file names, framework, or internals

* feat(system-prompt): add cross-session pending actions mechanism

* fix(system-prompt): never confirm/deny file existence, hide AI model, deflect attack patterns

* refactor(system-prompt): condense prompt, preserve all directives, reduce token usage

* fix(system-prompt): mark internal routing file names as secrets never spoken aloud

* refactor(system-prompt): response filter approach - mechanical output rules instead of intent-based

Key changes:
- 'Response Filter' section with mechanical rule: response text must never contain file names
- Provides substitution examples (file name -> natural language description)
- Explicit ban on executing commands targeting internal files
- Condensed from redundant sections into single cohesive flow
- Preserved Native Tool Usage and Pending Actions unchanged
